{"title":"Career Roadmap · Site Reliability Engineer (SRE)","role":"Site Reliability Engineer (SRE)","summary":"A Site Reliability Engineer (SRE) applies software engineering and systems engineering practices to keep applications and infrastructure reliable, scalable, available, secure, and observable.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E. (Bachelor of Technology / Engineering)","Course":"CSE - Full Stack / DevOps / SRE (Industry-integrated)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Site Reliability Engineer (SRE) applies software engineering and systems engineering practices to keep applications and infrastructure reliable, scalable, available, secure, and observable."},{"type":"p","text":"The role sits at the intersection of:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Software Engineering","Cloud","DevOps","Infrastructure","Observability","Automation","Reliability Engineering"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"An SRE typically works on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Production reliability"},{"text":"Cloud infrastructure"},{"text":"Deployment automation"},{"text":"Monitoring and observability"},{"text":"Incident response"},{"text":"Performance"},{"text":"Scalability"},{"text":"Capacity planning"},{"text":"Disaster recovery"},{"text":"Infrastructure automation"},{"text":"Reliability metrics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For this industry-integrated CSE specialization, the student should develop a strong foundation in software development first, followed by Linux, networking, cloud, containers, CI/CD, Kubernetes, Infrastructure as Code, monitoring, security, and SRE principles."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus","Typical Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Software + Infrastructure Foundation"},{"text":"SRE/DevOps Intern → Junior SRE / Cloud Engineer"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Production Reliability"},{"text":"SRE → Software/Platform Reliability Engineer"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Large-Scale Systems"},{"text":"Senior SRE / Platform Engineer"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Technical Leadership"},{"text":"Staff SRE / Principal Engineer / Reliability Architect"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During B.Tech","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Programming & Computer Science Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"SRE is not simply a server-administration role. Strong software-engineering fundamentals are essential."},{"type":"h","text":"Programming"},{"type":"p","text":"Become highly proficient in at least one:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Go"},{"text":"Java"},{"text":"C++"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For SRE, Python and Go are particularly useful."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Variables"},{"text":"Functions"},{"text":"OOP"},{"text":"Data structures"},{"text":"Error handling"},{"text":"File handling"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"Concurrency fundamentals"},{"text":"Testing"},{"text":"Package management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended combination"},{"type":"note","label":"Primary","text":"Python"},{"type":"note","label":"Secondary","text":"Go"},{"type":"p","text":"Java can also be retained if the student already has a strong Java foundation."},{"type":"h","text":"Data Structures & Algorithms"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Arrays"},{"text":"Strings"},{"text":"Linked lists"},{"text":"Stacks"},{"text":"Queues"},{"text":"Hash maps"},{"text":"Trees"},{"text":"Graphs"},{"text":"Sorting"},{"text":"Searching"},{"text":"Complexity analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"SRE interviews at stronger technology companies can include software-engineering and problem-solving questions."},{"type":"h","text":"Computer Science Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong understanding of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Operating systems"},{"text":"Computer networks"},{"text":"Databases"},{"text":"Distributed systems fundamentals"},{"text":"Computer architecture"},{"text":"Software engineering"},{"text":"Web architecture"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Linux & Networking"},{"type":"p","text":"Linux is one of the most important skills for an SRE."},{"type":"h","text":"Linux"},{"type":"p","text":"Become comfortable with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Filesystems"},{"text":"Permissions"},{"text":"Users/groups"},{"text":"Processes"},{"text":"Services"},{"text":"Packages"},{"text":"Logs"},{"text":"SSH"},{"text":"System resources"},{"text":"Networking"},{"text":"Shell scripting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Important commands:"},{"type":"p","text":"ls"},{"type":"p","text":"cd"},{"type":"p","text":"cp"},{"type":"p","text":"mv"},{"type":"p","text":"rm"},{"type":"p","text":"grep"},{"type":"p","text":"find"},{"type":"p","text":"awk"},{"type":"p","text":"sed"},{"type":"p","text":"cat"},{"type":"p","text":"chmod"},{"type":"p","text":"chown"},{"type":"p","text":"ps"},{"type":"p","text":"top"},{"type":"p","text":"htop"},{"type":"p","text":"df"},{"type":"p","text":"du"},{"type":"p","text":"free"},{"type":"p","text":"journalctl"},{"type":"p","text":"systemctl"},{"type":"p","text":"curl"},{"type":"p","text":"wget"},{"type":"p","text":"ssh"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn Bash scripting for automation."},{"type":"h","text":"Networking"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"OSI model"},{"text":"TCP/IP"},{"text":"IPv4"},{"text":"IPv6 basics"},{"text":"DNS"},{"text":"DHCP"},{"text":"HTTP/HTTPS"},{"text":"TLS"},{"text":"TCP"},{"text":"UDP"},{"text":"Routing"},{"text":"NAT"},{"text":"Load balancing"},{"text":"Firewalls"},{"text":"VPN"},{"text":"Proxies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Web request flow"},{"type":"flow","items":["User","DNS","CDN","Load Balancer","Web Server","Application","Database"]},{"type":"p","text":"An SRE should be able to troubleshoot failures at each layer."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Software & Web Architecture"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how modern applications are structured."},{"type":"h","text":"Backend"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"REST APIs"},{"text":"Authentication"},{"text":"Authorization"},{"text":"Databases"},{"text":"Caching"},{"text":"Message queues"},{"text":"Background workers"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Databases"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"PostgreSQL"},{"text":"Indexes"},{"text":"Transactions"},{"text":"Query optimization"},{"text":"Replication fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Also understand NoSQL concepts such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Redis"},{"text":"MongoDB"}]},{"type":"h","text":"System Design Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Horizontal scaling"},{"text":"Vertical scaling"},{"text":"Stateless services"},{"text":"Load balancing"},{"text":"Caching"},{"text":"Replication"},{"text":"Partitioning"},{"text":"Queues"},{"text":"Rate limiting"},{"text":"Fault tolerance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Users","Load Balancer","Application Instances","Cache","Database","Replica"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — DevOps & Cloud"},{"type":"p","text":"This is where the student should transition from software development into infrastructure engineering."},{"type":"h","text":"Git"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Git"},{"text":"GitHub/GitLab"},{"text":"Branching"},{"text":"Pull requests"},{"text":"Merge/rebase"},{"text":"Tags"},{"text":"Releases"},{"text":"Git workflows"}]},{"type":"h","text":"CI/CD"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Continuous Integration"},{"text":"Continuous Delivery"},{"text":"Continuous Deployment"},{"text":"Automated testing"},{"text":"Build pipelines"},{"text":"Artifact management"},{"text":"Deployment strategies"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Tools can include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GitHub Actions"},{"text":"GitLab CI/CD"},{"text":"Jenkins"},{"text":"Argo CD"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Pipeline"},{"type":"flow","items":["Code","Git","Build","Test","Security Scan","Artifact","Deploy","Monitor"]},{"type":"h","text":"Containers"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn Docker thoroughly."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Images"},{"text":"Containers"},{"text":"Dockerfiles"},{"text":"Volumes"},{"text":"Networks"},{"text":"Registries"},{"text":"Container lifecycle"},{"text":"Multi-stage builds"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Then learn container orchestration."},{"type":"h","text":"Kubernetes"},{"type":"p","text":"Kubernetes is highly relevant for SRE/platform roles."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pods"},{"text":"Deployments"},{"text":"Services"},{"text":"ConfigMaps"},{"text":"Secrets"},{"text":"Namespaces"},{"text":"Ingress"},{"text":"Persistent volumes"},{"text":"Jobs/CronJobs"},{"text":"Health probes"},{"text":"Resource requests/limits"},{"text":"Autoscaling"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Application","Container","Pod","Deployment","Kubernetes","Cloud Infrastructure"]},{"type":"h","text":"Cloud Computing"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose one cloud deeply."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AWS"},{"text":"Azure"},{"text":"Google Cloud"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For an AWS-oriented path, learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"EC2"},{"text":"VPC"},{"text":"IAM"},{"text":"S3"},{"text":"RDS"},{"text":"Load Balancer"},{"text":"Auto Scaling"},{"text":"CloudWatch"},{"text":"Route 53"},{"text":"Lambda"},{"text":"ECR"},{"text":"EKS"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Do not attempt to master every cloud simultaneously at the undergraduate stage."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Infrastructure as Code"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn Terraform."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Providers"},{"text":"Resources"},{"text":"Variables"},{"text":"Outputs"},{"text":"Modules"},{"text":"State"},{"text":"Remote state"},{"text":"Workspaces"},{"text":"Infrastructure lifecycle"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Terraform","Cloud Infrastructure","VPC","Compute","Database","Load Balancer"]},{"type":"p","text":"Also understand configuration-management concepts using tools such as Ansible."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — SRE Core"},{"type":"p","text":"The final year should focus specifically on reliability engineering."},{"type":"h","text":"Reliability Concepts"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Availability"},{"text":"Reliability"},{"text":"Scalability"},{"text":"Durability"},{"text":"Fault tolerance"},{"text":"Resilience"},{"text":"Redundancy"},{"text":"Capacity planning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"SLIs, SLOs & SLAs"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the distinction."},{"type":"h","text":"SLI"},{"type":"h","text":"Service Level Indicator"},{"type":"p","text":"A measurement of service behavior."},{"type":"p","text":"Examples:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Request latency"},{"text":"Error rate"},{"text":"Availability"}]},{"type":"h","text":"SLO"},{"type":"h","text":"Service Level Objective"},{"type":"p","text":"The reliability target."},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"p","text":"99.9% successful requests"},{"type":"h","text":"SLA"},{"type":"h","text":"Service Level Agreement"},{"type":"p","text":"A formal commitment between a service provider and customer."},{"type":"h","text":"Error Budgets"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the relationship:"},{"type":"flow","items":["SLO","Allowed Failure","Error Budget","Engineering Decisions"]},{"type":"p","text":"When the service consumes too much of its error budget, teams may prioritize reliability work over risky feature releases."},{"type":"h","text":"Observability"},{"type":"p","text":"Master the three traditional pillars:"},{"type":"h","text":"Metrics"},{"type":"p","text":"Examples:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CPU"},{"text":"Memory"},{"text":"Request rate"},{"text":"Error rate"},{"text":"Latency"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Logs"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Application logs"},{"text":"System logs"},{"text":"Structured logging"},{"text":"Centralized logging"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Traces"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Distributed tracing"},{"text":"Request IDs"},{"text":"Service dependencies"},{"text":"Trace propagation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Monitoring Stack"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn tools such as:"},{"type":"h","text":"Metrics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Prometheus"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Visualization"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Grafana"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Logs"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Loki"},{"text":"Elasticsearch/OpenSearch-based systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tracing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"OpenTelemetry"},{"text":"Jaeger"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact stack varies by company."},{"type":"h","text":"Incident Management"},{"type":"p","text":"An SRE must be able to respond systematically to production incidents."},{"type":"h","text":"Incident workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Alert","Triage","Assess Impact","Mitigate","Restore Service","Investigate Root Cause","Postmortem","Corrective Actions"]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Incident severity"},{"text":"On-call"},{"text":"Escalation"},{"text":"Runbooks"},{"text":"Incident communication"},{"text":"Root-cause analysis"},{"text":"Postmortems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Postmortem Culture"},{"type":"p","text":"A good postmortem should focus on systemic causes rather than blaming individuals."},{"type":"p","text":"Document:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What happened"},{"text":"Customer impact"},{"text":"Timeline"},{"text":"Detection"},{"text":"Mitigation"},{"text":"Root/contributing causes"},{"text":"What worked"},{"text":"What failed"},{"text":"Preventive actions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Reliability Engineering"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Redundancy"},{"text":"Failover"},{"text":"Graceful degradation"},{"text":"Circuit breakers"},{"text":"Retries"},{"text":"Timeouts"},{"text":"Rate limiting"},{"text":"Backpressure"},{"text":"Health checks"},{"text":"Disaster recovery"},{"text":"Backup and restore"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the danger of poorly designed retries and cascading failures."},{"type":"h","text":"Performance Engineering"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Latency"},{"text":"Throughput"},{"text":"Concurrency"},{"text":"CPU utilization"},{"text":"Memory utilization"},{"text":"Database performance"},{"text":"Query optimization"},{"text":"Load testing"},{"text":"Stress testing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Tools:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"k6"},{"text":"JMeter"},{"text":"Locust"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Security for SRE"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"IAM"},{"text":"Secrets management"},{"text":"TLS"},{"text":"Network security"},{"text":"Container security"},{"text":"Dependency scanning"},{"text":"Vulnerability management"},{"text":"Least privilege"},{"text":"Security logging"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand DevSecOps principles."},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Projects"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Production-Ready Cloud Application"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a full-stack application and deploy it to the cloud."},{"type":"p","text":"Architecture:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Users","DNS","Load Balancer","Frontend","Backend Services","Cache","Database"]},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HTTPS"},{"text":"Authentication"},{"text":"Logging"},{"text":"Monitoring"},{"text":"Automated deployment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Complete CI/CD Pipeline"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"flow","items":["GitHub","CI","Unit Tests","Build","Security Scan","Docker Image","Container Registry","Deployment","Monitoring"]},{"type":"p","text":"Implement rollback capability."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Kubernetes Production Lab"},{"type":"p","text":"Deploy an application using:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Docker"},{"text":"Kubernetes"},{"text":"Ingress"},{"text":"ConfigMaps"},{"text":"Secrets"},{"text":"Health checks"},{"text":"Resource limits"},{"text":"Horizontal Pod Autoscaler"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Monitor it using:"},{"type":"h","text":"Prometheus + Grafana"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — SRE Observability Platform"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a system that provides:"},{"type":"h","text":"Metrics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CPU"},{"text":"Memory"},{"text":"Request rate"},{"text":"Error rate"},{"text":"Latency"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Logs"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Application logs"},{"text":"Infrastructure logs"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Traces"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"API request tracing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Create alerts for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"High error rate"},{"text":"High latency"},{"text":"CPU saturation"},{"text":"Service downtime"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Incident Simulation"},{"type":"p","text":"Create deliberate failures:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Database unavailable"},{"text":"Service crash"},{"text":"DNS failure"},{"text":"High CPU"},{"text":"Memory leak"},{"text":"Network failure"},{"text":"Expired certificate"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Then document:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Incident","Detection","Triage","Mitigation","Recovery","Root Cause","Postmortem","Preventive Automation"]},{"type":"p","text":"This is particularly valuable because it demonstrates actual SRE thinking."},{"type":"h","text":"Internship Strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"SRE internships can be more competitive than general software internships, so the student should target adjacent roles as well."},{"type":"h","text":"Best internship titles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SRE Intern"},{"text":"DevOps Intern"},{"text":"Cloud Engineer Intern"},{"text":"Cloud Support Intern"},{"text":"Platform Engineering Intern"},{"text":"Infrastructure Engineering Intern"},{"text":"Backend Engineering Intern"},{"text":"Systems Engineering Intern"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong backend + cloud + DevOps internship can provide a valid pathway into an SRE role."},{"type":"h","text":"Entry-Level Career Options"},{"type":"h","text":"Direct"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Junior SRE"},{"text":"SRE Associate"},{"text":"Site Reliability Engineer"},{"text":"Reliability Engineer"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Adjacent"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"DevOps Engineer"},{"text":"Cloud Engineer"},{"text":"Platform Engineer"},{"text":"Infrastructure Engineer"},{"text":"Systems Engineer"},{"text":"Cloud Support Engineer"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Software route"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Backend Engineer"},{"text":"Production Engineer"},{"text":"Software Engineer – Infrastructure"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Employer Skill Matrix"},{"type":"table","header":["Employer Requirement","Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Production systems"},{"text":"Linux + networking"}],[{"text":"Cloud infrastructure"},{"text":"AWS/Azure/GCP"}],[{"text":"Deployment"},{"text":"CI/CD"}],[{"text":"Containers"},{"text":"Docker"}],[{"text":"Orchestration"},{"text":"Kubernetes"}],[{"text":"Automation"},{"text":"Python/Go/Bash"}],[{"text":"Infrastructure"},{"text":"Terraform"}],[{"text":"Monitoring"},{"text":"Prometheus/Grafana"}],[{"text":"Observability"},{"text":"Logs + metrics + traces"}],[{"text":"Reliability"},{"text":"SLO/SLI/error budgets"}],[{"text":"Incidents"},{"text":"On-call + incident response"}],[{"text":"Architecture"},{"text":"Distributed systems"}],[{"text":"Security"},{"text":"IAM + secrets + TLS"}],[{"text":"Performance"},{"text":"Load testing"}],[{"text":"Databases"},{"text":"SQL + performance"}],[{"text":"Collaboration"},{"text":"Documentation + communication"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Certifications & Learning"},{"type":"p","text":"Certifications can supplement hands-on experience."},{"type":"h","text":"Cloud"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose one primary ecosystem:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AWS"},{"text":"Azure"},{"text":"Google Cloud"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Kubernetes"},{"type":"p","text":"Consider:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Kubernetes fundamentals"},{"text":"CKA later, once the student has substantial hands-on Kubernetes experience"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Infrastructure"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Terraform"},{"text":"Ansible"}]},{"type":"h","text":"DevOps"},{"type":"p","text":"Build practical experience with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GitHub Actions"},{"text":"Jenkins"},{"text":"GitLab CI/CD"},{"text":"Argo CD"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Certifications should not substitute for deploying and troubleshooting real systems."},{"type":"h","text":"PG Options"},{"type":"p","text":"A master's degree is not required to become an SRE."},{"type":"p","text":"Relevant options include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Tech Computer Science"},{"text":"M.Tech Cloud Computing"},{"text":"M.Tech Distributed Systems"},{"text":"M.Tech Software Engineering"},{"text":"M.S. Computer Science"},{"text":"M.S. Distributed Systems"},{"text":"M.S. Cloud/Infrastructure Engineering"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For most students, strong industry experience and engineering projects can be more directly valuable than immediately pursuing a PG."},{"type":"h","text":"Career Specializations"}]},{"heading":"Cloud SRE","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AWS/Azure/GCP"},{"text":"Kubernetes"},{"text":"Terraform"},{"text":"Cloud networking"},{"text":"IAM"},{"text":"Reliability"}]}]},{"heading":"Platform Engineering","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build internal platforms that make developers more productive."},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Kubernetes"},{"text":"Internal developer platforms"},{"text":"CI/CD"},{"text":"Infrastructure automation"},{"text":"Developer tooling"},{"text":"Self-service infrastructure"}]}]},{"heading":"Production Engineering","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Software Engineering","Operations","Reliability"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Performance"},{"text":"Automation"},{"text":"Distributed systems"},{"text":"Production systems"}]}]},{"heading":"Observability Engineering","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Metrics"},{"text":"Logs"},{"text":"Traces"},{"text":"OpenTelemetry"},{"text":"Monitoring architecture"},{"text":"Alerting"},{"text":"Reliability analytics"}]}]},{"heading":"Reliability / Distributed Systems","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For advanced careers, focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Distributed systems"},{"text":"Consensus"},{"text":"Replication"},{"text":"Fault tolerance"},{"text":"Large-scale storage"},{"text":"High availability"},{"text":"Performance engineering"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Career Progression"},{"type":"h","text":"SRE route"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Tech CSE","SRE / DevOps / Cloud Intern","Junior SRE","SRE","Senior SRE","Staff SRE","Principal SRE / Reliability Architect"]},{"type":"h","text":"Platform route"},{"type":"flow","items":["Software / DevOps Engineer","Platform Engineer","Senior Platform Engineer","Staff Platform Engineer","Platform Architect"]},{"type":"h","text":"Engineering leadership"},{"type":"flow","items":["Senior SRE","Tech Lead","Engineering Manager","Senior Engineering Manager","Director / Head of Platform & Reliability"]},{"type":"p","text":"Titles vary significantly across companies."},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging Technologies"},{"type":"p","text":"The SRE discipline is increasingly influenced by:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-assisted operations"},{"text":"AIOps"},{"text":"Automated incident detection"},{"text":"Predictive failure detection"},{"text":"eBPF"},{"text":"OpenTelemetry"},{"text":"Serverless"},{"text":"Platform engineering"},{"text":"Internal developer platforms"},{"text":"Infrastructure as Code"},{"text":"GitOps"},{"text":"Confidential computing"},{"text":"Edge computing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"AI can assist with investigation and automation, but SREs still need strong fundamentals in systems, networking, software, and distributed computing."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Software Engineering"},{"type":"p","text":"Python"},{"type":"p","text":"Go"},{"type":"p","text":"Data Structures"},{"type":"p","text":"APIs"},{"type":"p","text":"Testing"},{"type":"p","text":"Git"},{"type":"p","text":"SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"System Design"},{"type":"h","text":"Systems"},{"type":"p","text":"Linux"},{"type":"p","text":"Networking"},{"type":"p","text":"DNS"},{"type":"p","text":"TCP/IP"},{"type":"p","text":"HTTP"},{"type":"p","text":"TLS"},{"type":"p","text":"Distributed Systems"},{"type":"h","text":"Cloud & DevOps"},{"type":"p","text":"AWS / Azure / GCP"},{"type":"p","text":"Docker"},{"type":"p","text":"Kubernetes"},{"type":"p","text":"Terraform"},{"type":"p","text":"CI/CD"},{"type":"p","text":"GitOps"},{"type":"h","text":"SRE"},{"type":"p","text":"SLI"},{"type":"p","text":"SLO"},{"type":"p","text":"SLA"},{"type":"p","text":"Error Budgets"},{"type":"p","text":"Incident Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Capacity Planning"},{"type":"p","text":"Reliability Engineering"},{"type":"h","text":"Observability"},{"type":"p","text":"Prometheus"},{"type":"p","text":"Grafana"},{"type":"p","text":"OpenTelemetry"},{"type":"p","text":"Logs"},{"type":"p","text":"Metrics"},{"type":"p","text":"Traces"},{"type":"p","text":"Alerting"},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"p","text":"Platform Engineering"},{"type":"p","text":"eBPF"},{"type":"p","text":"AIOps"},{"type":"p","text":"Distributed Systems"},{"type":"p","text":"Performance Engineering"},{"type":"p","text":"Infrastructure Automation"},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should be able to take an application from code to a monitored production-like environment:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Source Code","Git","Automated Tests","CI/CD","Docker","Kubernetes / Cloud","Infrastructure as Code","Monitoring","Logs + Metrics + Traces","Alerts","Incident Response","Postmortem","Reliability Improvements"]},{"type":"p","text":"The student should ideally graduate with strong Linux and networking skills, one programming language at an advanced level, cloud experience, Docker/Kubernetes, Terraform, CI/CD, observability, and at least one production-style reliability project."},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Tech/B.E. CSE – Full Stack / DevOps / SRE → SRE is a strong modern engineering pathway, but the student should understand that SRE is not simply DevOps with a different title. A strong SRE profile requires significant software engineering, systems, reliability, and production troubleshooting capability."},{"type":"p","text":"The core employability combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Linux","Networking","Programming","Cloud","Docker","Kubernetes","CI/CD","Terraform","Observability","SRE Principles."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"For long-term growth, the student should progress beyond deployment automation into reliability engineering, distributed systems, platform engineering, performance engineering, and production architecture. The strongest trajectory is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["SRE/DevOps Intern","Junior SRE","SRE","Senior SRE","Staff/Principal SRE or Reliability/Platform Architect"]}]}]}